# Crave Bakery — Cursor AI Project Rules & Reference

> **Purpose:** This file is the single source of truth for the Crave Bakery project.
> Load it into Cursor AI as a rule file. Every decision — naming, structure, design, logic — must follow what is defined here.

---

## 1. Project Overview

**Crave Bakery** is a full-featured bakery e-commerce platform. Customers can browse products, add to cart, place orders, write reviews, and save favourites. Admins manage the entire store — products, categories, orders, reviews, users, and site configuration — through a dedicated admin panel.

**Brand personality:** Warm, artisan, premium. Modern and clean — not rustic or vintage.  
**Brand name:** Crave Bakery  
**Tagline:** Baking Smiles, One Pastry At A Time

