## 2. Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Backend framework | Laravel 11 | PHP 8.2+ |
| Frontend bridge | Inertia.js v2 | SSR optional |
| Frontend framework | Vue 3 | Composition API + `<script setup>` only |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v3 | Utility-first, no inline styles |
| Auth scaffolding | Laravel Breeze | Inertia + Vue preset |
| Image management | Spatie Laravel MediaLibrary | All product/category images |
| SEO-friendly URLs | Spatie Laravel Sluggable | Products and categories |
| Payments | Laravel Cashier (Stripe) | Optional phase 2 |
| Frontend UI | @headlessui/vue | Accessible modals, dropdowns |
| Frontend utilities | @vueuse/core | Composables |
| Carousel / slider | Swiper | Homepage and product galleries |
| Icons | Tabler Icons (@tabler/icons-vue) | All icons throughout the app |
| HTTP client | Axios | Already included via Laravel |

### Setup Commands
```bash
composer require laravel/breeze spatie/laravel-medialibrary spatie/laravel-sluggable
php artisan breeze:install vue
npm install @headlessui/vue @vueuse/core swiper @tabler/icons-vue
```

