## 5. Database Schema

### `users`
```
id, name, email, email_verified_at, password, role (enum: super_admin|admin|user),
avatar, phone, date_of_birth, gender, 
permissions (json — for admin scoped permissions),
remember_token, timestamps
```

### `categories`
```
id, name, slug, description, parent_id (FK nullable — self-referencing),
image, banner_image, image_alt,
layout_style (enum: grid|list|masonry), products_per_page, default_sort,
show_in_navigation, show_in_homepage, custom_color,
meta_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url,
sort_order, status (enum: active|draft|archived),
timestamps, softDeletes
```

### `products`
```
id, name, slug, short_description, description,
regular_price, sale_price, cost_price,
sku, barcode,
stock_quantity, low_stock_threshold, allow_backorders,
stock_status (enum: in_stock|out_of_stock|on_backorder),
is_featured, is_active, show_in_search,
status (enum: active|draft|archived),
meta_title, meta_description, meta_keywords, og_image, canonical_url,
published_at,
timestamps, softDeletes
```

### `category_product` (pivot — many-to-many)
```
id, category_id (FK), product_id (FK)
```

### `attributes`
```
id, name, type (enum: text|number|color|boolean),
display_type (enum: pills|dropdown|swatches|checkboxes),
sort_order, timestamps
```

### `attribute_values`
```
id, attribute_id (FK), value, color_swatch, sort_order, timestamps
```

### `product_attribute_values` (pivot)
```
id, product_id (FK), attribute_value_id (FK)
```

### `orders`
```
id, user_id (FK), order_number (unique string e.g. CB-00482),
status (enum: pending|processing|shipped|delivered|cancelled),
payment_status (enum: pending|paid|refunded),
payment_method, transaction_id,
subtotal, discount_amount, promo_code, delivery_fee, tax_amount, total,
first_name, last_name, email, phone,
address_line1, address_line2, city, state, postal_code, country,
delivery_method (enum: standard|express),
delivery_notes,
estimated_delivery_at, delivered_at, paid_at,
notes (internal admin notes, json array),
timestamps, softDeletes
```

### `order_items`
```
id, order_id (FK), product_id (FK),
product_name (snapshot), product_sku (snapshot),
selected_attributes (json — snapshot of chosen attribute values),
quantity, unit_price, line_total,
timestamps
```

### `carts`
```
id, user_id (FK nullable), session_id (for guest carts),
timestamps
```

### `cart_items`
```
id, cart_id (FK), product_id (FK),
selected_attributes (json),
quantity, timestamps
```

### `favourites`
```
id, user_id (FK), product_id (FK), timestamps
```

### `collections` (user-curated favourite groups)
```
id, user_id (FK), name, description,
privacy (enum: private|public),
timestamps
```

### `collection_product` (pivot)
```
id, collection_id (FK), product_id (FK)
```

### `reviews`
```
id, user_id (FK), product_id (FK), order_id (FK nullable — verify purchase),
rating (tinyint 1–5), title, body,
status (enum: pending|approved|flagged|rejected),
flag_reason, flagged_at,
helpful_yes, helpful_no,
admin_response, admin_response_at,
is_verified_purchase,
timestamps, softDeletes
```

### `review_photos`
```
id, review_id (FK), path, timestamps
```

### `promo_codes`
```
id, code (unique), type (enum: percentage|fixed),
value, min_order_amount, max_uses, used_count,
starts_at, expires_at, is_active, timestamps
```

### `addresses`
```
id, user_id (FK), label (Home|Office|Other),
first_name, last_name, phone,
address_line1, address_line2, city, state, postal_code, country,
is_default, timestamps
```

### `site_settings`
```
id, key (unique string), value (text), timestamps
```
> Site settings are accessed via `SiteSetting::get('key')` helper — never query directly in controllers.

### `activity_log`
> Use **Spatie Laravel Activity Log** package — do not build custom.
```bash
composer require spatie/laravel-activitylog
```

### `admin_invitations`
```
id, email, role, permissions (json), token (unique),
invited_by (FK users.id), accepted_at, expires_at, timestamps
```

