## 8. Inertia Shared Data

In `App\Http\Middleware\HandleInertiaRequests`:

```php
public function share(Request $request): array
{
    return [
        ...parent::share($request),
        'auth' => [
            'user' => $request->user() ? [
                'id'          => $request->user()->id,
                'name'        => $request->user()->name,
                'email'       => $request->user()->email,
                'role'        => $request->user()->role,
                'avatar'      => $request->user()->avatar,
                'permissions' => $request->user()->permissions,
            ] : null,
        ],
        'cart' => [
            'count' => CartService::getCount($request),
        ],
        'flash' => [
            'success' => $request->session()->get('success'),
            'error'   => $request->session()->get('error'),
        ],
        'site' => [
            'name'    => SiteSettingService::get('site_name', 'Crave Bakery'),
            'logo'    => SiteSettingService::get('site_logo'),
            'tagline' => SiteSettingService::get('site_tagline'),
        ],
    ];
}
```

Access in any Vue component: `$page.props.auth.user`, `$page.props.cart.count`, `$page.props.flash`

