## 9. Design System

### 9.1 Brand Identity
- **Name:** Crave Bakery
- **Personality:** Warm, artisan, premium — modern and clean, never rustic or vintage
- **Tone:** Friendly, trustworthy, appetising

### 9.2 Color Palette

| Token name | Hex value | Tailwind config key | Usage |
|---|---|---|---|
| Primary (espresso) | `#3D1A0E` | `primary` | Navbar bg, hero bg, strong headings, sidebar |
| Accent (orange-red) | `#E8572A` | `accent` | All CTA buttons, active states, highlights, links |
| Surface | `#FDF6EE` | `surface` | All page backgrounds |
| Card | `#FFFFFF` | `card` | Product cards, modals, panels |
| Text primary | `#1A1A1A` | `text-primary` | All body text |
| Text muted | `#6B6B6B` | `text-muted` | Subtitles, helpers, secondary info |
| Border | `#E5DDD4` | `border-base` | Input borders, dividers, card borders |
| Success | `#2E7D32` | `success` | Order delivered, in stock, approved |
| Error | `#C62828` | `error` | Validation errors, delete actions |
| Warning | `#EF9F27` | `warning` | Pending status, low stock, unsaved changes |
| Info | `#185FA5` | `info` | Processing status, informational badges |

Add to `tailwind.config.js`:
```js
theme: {
  extend: {
    colors: {
      primary:   '#3D1A0E',
      accent:    '#E8572A',
      surface:   '#FDF6EE',
      success:   '#2E7D32',
      error:     '#C62828',
      warning:   '#EF9F27',
      info:      '#185FA5',
    }
  }
}
```

