## 14. SEO Strategy

- Every public page uses `<Head>` from `@inertiajs/vue3` to set meta tags
- Products and categories pass `meta_title`, `meta_description`, `og_image` from the controller
- Global defaults come from `SiteSettingService` and are merged in the controller
- Title template: `{page_title} | {site_name}`
- `sitemap.xml` auto-generated — regenerated on product/category create/update/delete
- `robots.txt` stored in `site_settings` and served dynamically
- All product/category URLs use slugs (never IDs)
- Canonical URLs set on all product and category pages

