## 17. Naming Conventions Cheatsheet

| Thing | Convention | Example |
|---|---|---|
| Laravel controller | PascalCase + Controller | `ProductController` |
| Laravel model | PascalCase singular | `Product` |
| Laravel migration | snake_case descriptive | `create_products_table` |
| Laravel route name | dot.notation | `products.show` |
| Vue page component | PascalCase in folder | `Products/Show.vue` |
| Vue shared component | PascalCase with prefix | `AppButton.vue`, `AdminSidebar.vue` |
| Vue composable | camelCase with `use` | `useCart.js` |
| Tailwind class order | Layout → Spacing → Typography → Color → Effect | standard Prettier plugin order |
| DB column | snake_case | `is_featured`, `meta_title` |
| JS variable | camelCase | `cartItems`, `isLoading` |
| CSS custom property | kebab-case | `--color-accent` |

